<!--
Per-app CLAUDE.md template for apps/mobile-* and apps/native-* directories.
Copy to apps/<your-app>/CLAUDE.md and fill in. The mobile reviewer agents
(mobile-manifest-auditor, mobile-release-gate, mobile-compose-reviewer) and
bin/bstack-mobile-parity read this file for per-app context.

Repo-level rules in .claude/rules/critical-patterns.md still apply on top of
whatever this file says — this file fills in app-specific values, it does not
override rules.
-->

# `apps/<app-name>` — App Context

## App identity

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| App name (human) | <e.g. Driver> |
| Bundle ID (iOS) | <com.bigstep.driver> |
| Application ID (Android) | <com.bigstep.driver> |
| App Store ID | <numeric ASC ID> |
| Play package | <com.bigstep.driver> |
| Apple Team ID | <ABCDEF1234> |
| Google Play account | <bigstep-play-org> |

## Stack deviations from ADR-001

If this app deviates from the ADR-001 locked stack table, list deviations here with rationale. An empty list means "no deviations." Reviewers cross-check this against the auditor's locked-stack drift findings.

| Dep | ADR-001 default | This app uses | Rationale |
|---|---|---|---|
| _none_ | — | — | — |

