| Min iOS | <e.g. 16.0> |
| Min Android API | <e.g. 24 (Android 7.0)> |
| Target API (Android) | <e.g. 35 (Android 15)> |
| Compile SDK (Android) | <e.g. 35> |
| Expo SDK (if RN) | <e.g. 52> |

## Crash reporting (§ 5.6)

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| iOS SDK | Sentry React Native / Sentry Apple / Crashlytics — pick one |
| Android SDK | Sentry React Native / Sentry Android / Crashlytics — pick one |
| Sentry project | <slug> |
| Sentry release naming | `<app-name>@<versionName>+<buildNumber>` |
| Source-maps uploaded? (§ 12.8) | Yes (CI step) / No (REVIEW) |

