| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| RUM provider | (none) / Sentry Performance / Datadog RUM Mobile |
| Cold-start TTI budget | <e.g. 1500 ms on Pixel 4a> |
| ANR rate gate | <e.g. ≤ 0.47% per Play Vitals> |

