| Feature-flag SDK | Statsig / LaunchDarkly / Unleash / GrowthBook / in-house |
| Kill-switch min-version endpoint | <e.g. /api/v1/min-version> |
| Force-update screen file | <path in repo> |
| Maestro flow that tests it | <path> |

